      "citation": "卷268·乾化二年（912）·zztj-v268-y0912-p023·原文件第63行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/99be897d/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-268/year-0912/part-03/sources/library/tongjian-268-912-liyu-continuation/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "052c8ea7b4315cdcd2cced1598ba0fab3fcf48e0d38697870f4a92b4775d7c06",
      "quotation": "知诰在升州，独选用廉吏，修明政教，招延四方士大夫，倾家赀无所爱。洪州进士宋齐丘，好纵横之术，谒知诰，知诰奇之，辟为推官，与判官王令谋、参军王翃专主谋议，以牙吏马仁裕、周宗、曹悰为腹心。",
      "quotation_verified": true
    },
    {
      "person_id": "600b7aa1-b6b4-52ad-8ce1-2e5d07e17be5",
