      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/077b3114/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-277/year-0931/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-277-931-october/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "1a963d90618f824db06926206e4aa22b7e92cb3e8b8280de32a34266617d62c8",
      "quotation": "丙子，命其子节度使使继鹏权军府事。",
